1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,190
Is your network downloading
all of this several times?

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,849
Why should every machine download
the same packages from the Internet?

3
00:00:07,499 --> 00:00:10,585
Cache & Carry stores them
centrally on your network.

4
00:00:10,685 --> 00:00:13,741
Download once. Then use it locally.

5
00:00:14,391 --> 00:00:18,457
Your own LAN cache. Open
source and free on GitHub.
